  "lyrics": [
    {
      "section_id": "section_0",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "No friendly warfare, this ain't wrestlin'",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "There's nothin' staged over here, you're trippin' Mescaline",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Drinkin', coulda got smacked for what he thinkin'",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Coulda said the word, then whack! Abe Lincoln",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "And still spend stacks off crack, stay crinklin'",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "This game's built to get got while blinkin'",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Rappers do big up jail like a recruiter",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Let 'em tend ta hit a boy, said he was a shooter",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "Told him \"Man up, or keep it pushin' like a scooter\"",
          "rhyme": "9R",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "Then said nuttin' and didn't pass the Buddha",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "Lo and behold, police shows up",
          "rhyme": "9p",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "Spit his shitty sixteen and got his self froze up, up",
          "rhyme": "9p",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "His story had a moral, it's buried in the soil",
          "rhyme": "al",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "Vil put it in her back like the epidural",
          "rhyme": "al",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "Kids: eat, sleep, stay away from creeps",
          "rhyme": "ip",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "Spit it from the heart, this game's for keeps",
          "rhyme": "ip",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "So peep",
          "rhyme": "ip",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "Yeah, saga of a true B-Boy",
          "rhyme": "Oj",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "18",
          "text": "Beware any likenesses or imagery is a decoy",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "19",
          "text": "Sho nuff, yo fluff, force like Bruce Leroy",
          "rhyme": "aj",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "20",
          "text": "Bring trouble up and get double cut— keloid",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "21",
          "text": "Bubble up, run 'em up, destroy",
          "rhyme": "aj",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "22",
          "text": "And anything else you see— void",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "23",
          "text": "Rightful ownership",
          "rhyme": "ip",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "24",
          "text": "Got a bone to pick with the phoniest colonialist",
          "rhyme": "ist",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "25",
          "text": "Who own a ship",
          "rhyme": "ip",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "26",
          "text": "The loneliest known to rip",
          "rhyme": "ip",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "27",
          "text": "Known to sip pine and ripple",
          "rhyme": "ypl",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "28",
          "text": "Find yourself in a bind and pickle",
          "rhyme": "abl",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "29",
          "text": "Don't bite the hand that feeds you, bite the nipple",
          "rhyme": "ypl",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "30",
          "text": "In this land of black and brown, ain't no backin' down",
          "rhyme": "awn",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "31",
          "text": "As foul as that sound, it's hard to find a cap and gown",
          "rhyme": "awn",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "32",
          "text": "But it's always like a MAC around",
          "rhyme": "awnd",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "33",
          "text": "B-r-r-r-r-at!! Man down",
          "rhyme": "awn",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "34",
          "text": "Metal is empowered, devil is a coward",
          "rhyme": "aRd",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "35",
          "text": "It all smells of high hell like no one ever showered",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "36",
          "text": "Scrub behind ya ears, shed the final tears",
          "rhyme": "aR",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "37",
          "text": "Remember what the world was like in the final years",
          "rhyme": "aR",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "38",
          "text": "Just a speck of dirt in the universe, snap fingers",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "39",
          "text": "Just like that— assume the worst",
          "rhyme": "Est",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "40",
          "text": "Back in business, guzzle beers, track and fitness",
          "rhyme": "Es",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "41",
          "text": "Laps get faster, could've missed Christmas",
          "rhyme": "as",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "42",
          "text": "What is this?",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        }
      ],
